{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Smart. Stay Cozy. Master the Board.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Solo Chess (formerly Pokerii)</strong>, the cozy roguelike deckbuilder where every card is a chess piece, and every play is packed with strategy. Place cards on a 3\u00d73 board, trigger unique piece effects, and build powerful combos to score points and clear wave after wave of tactical challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pets, choose food, and reshape your deck between rounds at a charming caf\u00e9 filled with helpful upgrades and surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Solo Chess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/extras/d77d3523d14d0d8573ab7d65c7be4664.poster.avif?t=1764615734\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/extras/d77d3523d14d0d8573ab7d65c7be4664.webm?t=1764615734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/extras/d77d3523d14d0d8573ab7d65c7be4664.mp4?t=1764615734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by chess and minimalist roguelikes, <strong>Solo Chess</strong> blends tactical decision-making with cozy aesthetics. Whether you are lining up a combo with Pawns or duplicating effects with a clever Queen placement, your board is small\u2014but your plays are mighty.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/extras/452f7f7cd94f1cea18dab030c7ed3dd4.poster.avif?t=1764615734\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/extras/452f7f7cd94f1cea18dab030c7ed3dd4.webm?t=1764615734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/extras/452f7f7cd94f1cea18dab030c7ed3dd4.mp4?t=1764615734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess-Inspired Deckbuilding</strong><br>Start with a 16-card deck made of Pawns, Knights, Bishops, Rooks, Queens, and Kings\u2014each with a unique scoring effect based on its traditional movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo-Centric Scoring</strong><br>Hit specific rank sums like 4, 8, or 12 to trigger special combo bonuses. Align your plays and maximize your score with tight math and clever placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-Based Roguelike Runs</strong><br>Face an escalating series of challenges. Every board layout and card draw becomes a new puzzle to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Deck with Pets &amp; Food</strong><br>Visit a cozy caf\u00e9 between waves to adopt pets (passive bonuses), select food (temporary buffs), or use special tools to enhance your deck.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic Deck Tools</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/extras/060fa40b5d43f6e77407baec65687992.poster.avif?t=1764615734\" width=614 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/extras/060fa40b5d43f6e77407baec65687992.webm?t=1764615734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/extras/060fa40b5d43f6e77407baec65687992.mp4?t=1764615734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Gift</strong> \u2013 Open surprise packages with powerful effects\u2014sometimes risky, always fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Promotion</strong> \u2013 Upgrade one of your cards into a more powerful version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrifice</strong> \u2013 Remove a card to fine-tune your build and increase synergy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Details</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 chess-inspired cards with unique strategic effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ pets with passive effects to enhance your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 difficulty levels to test your deckbuilding skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple unlockable decks with unique starting setups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 visual variants per card through collectible auras.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra card powers granted by charms and bindings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many sum-based combos to chase every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck upgrades, removals, and surprises via caf\u00e9 visits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wholesome chibi art, clean UI, and cozy sound design.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Small Deck. Big Brain. Cozy Vibes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you are chasing high scores or savoring the strategy, <strong>Solo Chess</strong> offers a charming, replayable twist on chess and deckbuilding\u2014perfect for quick runs, clever plays, and relaxing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Great Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/ddc25c4cb1a783e969e0951c2bb0ca66c694c42a.jpg"},{"name":"Great Score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/9c2647d9da38b9189c43c7c9839ae2153fadc689.jpg"},{"name":"First Success","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/8536a9aa4a02841ca7ec5c5f8c67ea832406b806.jpg"},{"name":"Powerful Combo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/bf9a1a5dbab0f30242e07311755a544c3a248884.jpg"},{"name":"Strongest Combo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/27acf8a989ffea41b55c441dec7d9e7e4cf0a921.jpg"},{"name":"Item Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/0ab2d97d0c374f5a26e5d014032223f666b53c2d.jpg"},{"name":"Experienced Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/332152fd043b840fa6491e9f199e9b7dd3dd5979.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/51359ad5a01da27117fcc9d4db87a078fe2b5738.jpg"},{"name":"Unlimited Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/9835460fd2448022fc94e03eee30fd48e3687453.jpg"},{"name":"Strategic Sacrifice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3691940/d0a89057c0970615aa870876be5de089fb80cd40.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691940?t=1764615734","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/b38e70180b742699300d364da570dfe037a416f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764615734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/6ac9822d63387ec363e9e8f6081493bdf3899d02/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764615734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691940/6ac9822d63387ec363e9e8f6081493bdf3899d02/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764615734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}]